# IONOS Cloud MCP Server Configuration Example

# Authentication with username and password
IONOS_USERNAME=your-username-here
IONOS_PASSWORD=your-password-here

# OR use token-based authentication
# IONOS_TOKEN=your-api-token-here

# Note: You only need to set either username/password OR token, not both.
# Get your credentials from https://dcd.ionos.com/
